-- `swift test` — passed, 158 tests in 17 suites.
-- `make relay-protocol-check` — passed: schema/negative/drift/digest gates, Go gofmt/vet/tests, Swift build, and 48 RelayProtocol tests in 5 suites.
-- Interim Go smoke coverage — 85.7% of statements.
+- `gofmt -d relay/internal/protocol/*.go` — clean.
 - `git diff --check` — passed.
+- `task-board validate` — passed.
 
 ## Environment note
 
